left lung) before mapping findings to options.\",\n    \"Verify that at least two independent visual sources agree on the spatial claim before finalizing the answer.\"\n  ]\n}\n```"},"finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":567,"total_tokens":933,"completion_tokens":366,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":567},"completion_tokens_details":{"text_tokens":366}}}